2.1 Functional Requirements
EduGenie should provide the following functions:
1. Question & Answer
The user enters a question and receives an AI-generated answer.
2. Concept Explanation
The system explains difficult concepts in a simple and understandable manner.
3. Quiz Generation
The system generates multiple-choice questions from a given passage.
4. Summarization
The system converts long educational passages into concise summaries.
5. Learning Recommendations
The system creates a structured learning path from beginner to advanced level.
The project document specifies these five major functionalities. EduGenie-Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant_Document.docx
